# apps/api — local secrets for `wrangler dev`. Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored)
# and fill in. In production the same two keys are set with
#   npx wrangler secret put TMD_UID
#   npx wrangler secret put TMD_UKEY
# (see docs/deploy.md §0 and §3). Without them only the TMD seismic feed
# degrades — /api/v1/health reports the earthquakes source as `degraded` with
# lastError "TMD credentials not configured"; USGS, EMSC and every other
# source keep working.

# TMD open-data API credentials — register at https://data.tmd.go.th/
TMD_UID=""
TMD_UKEY=""
